<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Sunkist, San Miguel win PBA openers.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Sunkist, San Miguel win PBA openers.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the opening games on Sunday in the Philippine Basketball Association third conference which includes American imports:</p>
<p>San Miguel Beer beat Mobiline 105-104 (50-51)</p>
<p>Sunkist Orange beat Alaska Milk 93-91 (44-46)</p>
